Mark 11:1 , Christ rides with triumph into Jerusalem;
Mark 11:12 , curses the fruitless fig-tree;
Mark 11:15 , purges the temple;
Mark 11:20 , exhorts his disciples to stedfastness of faith, and to forgive their enemies;
Mark 11:27 , and defends the lawfulness of his actions by the witness of John, who was a man sent of God.
